  "notes": "v0.6.0 adds a trusted-device model and permission-respecting auto-connect layer: Nearby view, persistent pairing token, automatic reconnect for previously paired Spatial Nodes, LAN reachability/service readiness for trusted devices, and explicit BLE GATT inspection only after the user trusts the device. No password bypass, forced pairing, microphone bypass, or exploitation."
